OL,3,GNEWSADoubt cast over town's new #45m
OL,4,Aentertainment venue
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new #45m town centre entertainment
OL,7,Fvenue may not be built following a
OL,8,Fchange of council leadership.
OL,10,FPlans for the purpose-built,
OL,11,F2,000-capacity venue on the levelled
OL,12,FSwindon bus station site in Wiltshire
OL,13,Fwere announced earlier this year, after
OL,14,Fthe government committed #20m towards
OL,15,Fthe project.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
