OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSADoubt cast over town's new #45m
OL,4,Aentertainment venue
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut Gary Sumner, leader of the minority
OL,7,FConservative leadership at Swindon
OL,8,FBorough Council, which took control in
OL,9,FMay, said: "Any decision to borrow #20m
OL,10,Fat a time when the council finances are
OL,11,Fperilous would be a really, really
OL,12,Fbrave decision."
OL,14,FJim Robbins, leader of the previous
OL,15,FLabour administration, said: "Swindon
OL,16,Fdeserves a modern, ambitious
OL,17,Fentertainment venue in the heart of our
OL,18,Ftown."
